class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></p><svg class=\"pe-domain-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 185\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"每个输入都能找到它的相反数，包括两个实心端点。定义域对称，接下来才能检查函数值。\">\n    <path class=\"pe-axis\" d=\"M35 90H525\"/>\n    <path class=\"pe-domain-line\" d=\"M136 90H424\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result\" cx=\"136\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"64\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"136\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"208\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"280\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"352\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"424\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"496\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n    <path class=\"pe-guide\" d=\"M388 53V90M172 53V90\"/>\n    <circle class=\"pe-dot pe-right\" cx=\"388\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-left\" cx=\"172\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-right\" x=\"388\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = 1.5</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-left\" x=\"172\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−x = −1.5</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label\" x=\"280\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\">定义域对称：输入能够配对</text>\n  </svg><p class=\"pe-conclusion\"><span data-math-text>每个输入都能找到它的相反数，包括两个实心端点。定义域对称，接下来才能检查函数值。</span></p></section><section class=\"pe-panel\" data-pe-panel=\"halfOpen\" hidden><p class=\"pe-formula\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=[-2,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><svg class=\"pe-domain-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 185\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"−2 可以取到，2 却不能取到。两个端点一实一空，定义域不对称，函数必定非奇非偶。\">\n    <path class=\"pe-axis\" d=\"M35 90H525\"/>\n    <path class=\"pe-domain-line\" d=\"M136 90H424\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result\" cx=\"136\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result pe-open\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"64\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"136\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"208\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"280\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"352\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"424\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"496\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n    <path class=\"pe-guide\" d=\"M136 53V90M424 53V90\"/>\n    <circle class=\"pe-dot pe-right\" cx=\"136\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-left pe-open\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-right\" x=\"136\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = −2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-left\" x=\"424\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−x = 2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label\" x=\"280\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\">定义域不对称：找到一个无法配对的输入</text>\n  </svg><p class=\"pe-conclusion\"><span data-math-text>−2 可以取到，2 却不能取到。两个端点一实一空，定义域不对称，函数必定非奇非偶。</span></p></section><section class=\"pe-panel\" data-pe-panel=\"asymmetric\" hidden><p class=\"pe-formula\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=[-1,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></p><svg class=\"pe-domain-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 185\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"2 在定义域内，−2 不在。仅有一部分输入能配对还不够，函数必定非奇非偶。\">\n    <path class=\"pe-axis\" d=\"M35 90H525\"/>\n    <path class=\"pe-domain-line\" d=\"M208 90H424\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result\" cx=\"208\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"64\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"136\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"208\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"280\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"352\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"424\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"496\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n    <path class=\"pe-guide\" d=\"M424 53V90M136 53V90\"/>\n    <circle class=\"pe-dot pe-right\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-left pe-open\" cx=\"136\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-right\" x=\"424\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = 2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-left\" x=\"136\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−x = −2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label\" x=\"280\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\">定义域不对称：找到一个无法配对的输入</text>\n  </svg><p class=\"pe-conclusion\"><span data-math-text>2 在定义域内，−2 不在。仅有一部分输入能配对还不够，函数必定非奇非偶。</span></p></section><section class=\"pe-panel\" data-pe-panel=\"hole\" hidden><p class=\"pe-formula\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\frac{2x^2+2x}{x+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.4213em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>，</span><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=