xt><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"496\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n    <path class=\"pe-guide\" d=\"M352 53V90M208 53V90\"/>\n    <circle class=\"pe-dot pe-right\" cx=\"352\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-left pe-open\" cx=\"208\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-right\" x=\"352\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = 1</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-left\" x=\"208\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−x = −1</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label\" x=\"280\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\">定义域不对称：找到一个无法配对的输入</text>\n  </svg><p class=\"pe-conclusion\"><span data-math-text>约分后虽然得到 2x，原函数在 −1 处仍无定义，而 1 可以取。这个缺口不能补回，原函数非奇非偶。</span></p></section><section class=\"pe-panel\" data-pe-panel=\"pairedHoles\" hidden><p class=\"pe-formula\"><span data-math-text><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-1,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></p><svg class=\"pe-domain-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 185\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"−1 与 1 同时被排除，剩下的输入仍能一一配对。定义域对称；是否奇、偶还要检查函数值。\">\n    <path class=\"pe-axis\" d=\"M35 90H525\"/>\n    <path class=\"pe-domain-line\" d=\"M64 90H496\"/><path class=\"pe-domain-line\" d=\"M70 85l-6 5 6 5 M490 85l6 5-6 5\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result pe-open\" cx=\"208\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-result pe-open\" cx=\"352\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"64\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"136\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"208\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"280\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"352\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"424\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text class=\"pe-tick\" x=\"496\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n    <path class=\"pe-guide\" d=\"M424 53V90M136 53V90\"/>\n    <circle class=\"pe-dot pe-right\" cx=\"424\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/><circle class=\"pe-dot pe-left\" cx=\"136\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\"/>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-right\" x=\"424\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x = 2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label pe-left\" x=\"136\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−x = −2</text>\n    <text class=\"pe-label\" x=\"280\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\">定义域对称：输入能够配对</text>\n  </svg><p class=\"pe-conclusion\"><span data-math-text>−1 与 1 同时被排除，剩下的输入仍能一一配对。定义域对称；是否奇、偶还要检查函数值。</span></p></section></div>"}
